Speech models
================================================================================
The whisper models (`ggml-*.bin`) are NOT redistributed. The app downloads the
one a person chooses from huggingface.co at first use, against a pinned SHA-256
(`WhisperModel.kt`). Their terms are the model publisher's, not this project's.
